    "finding": "At360ticks a fully glass-covered leaf remained locked with no tool progress, but tool_goal was true and blocked status stayed false. Optical sight saw wood while the physical ray hit the pane."
  },
  "changes": [
    "Work-position validation uses the physical world ray instead of optical sight. Optical perception, actual hand gating, reach distances, capability, stock, threat priority and geometry remain unchanged.",
    "Eighteen additional cases qualify full glass cover/wait/removal/resumption, partial panes and low-gap crouched access across Pick/Wedge and three orientations. Bypass cases keep glass active and undamaged; successful tool progress must have a real same-leaf hand hit.",
    "The explicit UDP fixture now covers both opaque and clear glass, including waiting status, zero tool progress while blocked and actual resumption. The separate canonical motel mesh/slow-join qualification remains intact.",
    "Protocol/replay v38 requires matching peers and new recordings/saves for changed deterministic planning behavior. No extra wire fields were added."
  ],
